#: desc: Multi-line top docs: indentation, blank lines, comments and empty doc lines
-v COLOR=0 test/fixtures/Makefile.docs-multiline
#: stdout
-----------------------
Available targets:
-----------------------
t1   Spaces before the ## token are allowed and stripped
     top docs can have multiple lines
       indentation can be used for emphasis
t2   Blank lines
     between docs
     are ignored
t3   Comment lines between docs are skipped
     and empty doc lines are kept

-----------------------
